# 2. CANONICALIZE AI SCENE SCHEMA

Target schema harus menggunakan satu vocabulary.

Canonical fields:
```text
hpChange
manaChange
goldChange
receivedItemId
consumedItemId
reputationChange
factDiscovered

missionLog.objective
```

Cari semua penggunaan:
```text
proposedHpChange
proposedManaChange
proposedGoldChange
addLedgerFact
reputation
targetGoal
```

Audit minimal:
```text
sceneSchema.js
promptBuilder.js
fallbackGenerator.js
AI response parser
story services
gameStateEngine
tests
```

## Aturan
Jangan mempertahankan dua format secara permanen.
Jika tidak ada kebutuhan backward compatibility, hapus legacy alias.

Pipeline yang diinginkan:
```text
AI Provider
   ↓
raw response
   ↓
parse
   ↓
normalize
   ↓
Zod validation
   ↓
Canonical Scene
   ↓
Game State Engine
```

AI tidak boleh langsung memodifikasi database.

