# 7. SAVE/LOAD ROUND-TRIP TEST

Buat test:
```text
create session
   ↓
modify state
   ↓
save
   ↓
load
   ↓
compare state
```

Minimal validasi:
```text
character
HP
maxHP
mana
maxMana
gold
inventory
location
current story state
turnCount
worldLedger
reputation
facts
mission state
active branch
```

Jika combat state memang persistable, masukkan juga combat state.

Target:
```text
state_before_save ≈ state_after_load
```
Perbedaan hanya boleh terjadi pada metadata yang memang seharusnya berubah, misalnya timestamp.

