# 9. API ERROR CONTRACT

Buat standar backend.
Contoh:
```json
{
  "success": false,
  "error": {
    "code": "SESSION_NOT_FOUND",
    "message": "Session tidak ditemukan"
  }
}
```

Gunakan error code yang stabil.
Contoh:
```text
SESSION_NOT_FOUND
INVALID_SCENE
INVALID_ACTION
SAVE_FAILED
LOAD_FAILED
INVALID_SAVE_FILE
AI_GENERATION_FAILED
VALIDATION_FAILED
UNAUTHORIZED
FORBIDDEN
```

Jangan mengubah struktur response hanya karena endpoint berbeda.

